// Pillar 5 Step 4, M14 irrigation (harvest mornings, every other Saturday): the gardener on the rota shows you the
// first rack. Tove Cruz (they/them, senior gardener, messy, shy). Seat E2. Head writer W2.
title: The racks
from: Tove Cruz
gist: Tove showed you the garden's irrigation: clear the nozzles on each rack so the water runs even.
== lines
cruz-tove: Oh. Hello. You're the Works one. Good.   [nod]
cruz-tove > you: The nozzles clog. Roots, grit. The plants at the end go thirsty.
cruz-tove: Clear each one. Watch the water run even. Then the next rack.
cruz-tove: Sorry about the mud. There's always mud.   [laugh]
